<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Zekariah</book>
  <para style="h">Zekariah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zekariah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekariah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zekariah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias kum nihna, kha giatna in, Iddo tapa, Berekiah tapa, Zekariah, zawlnei kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pipute uh tung ah Toupa nakpitak in a lungkim kei hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in nang a kiang uah, huchibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Ka kiang ah hongkik un, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, huan na kiang uah ka hongkik ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, “Tuin na omdan gilou ua kipan leh na thilhih giloute ua kipan hongkik un” chi a zawlnei masate’n a genna uh, na pipute uh bang in omkei un: himahleh amau hon zakei ua, hon ngaikhe sam kei uh sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na Pipute uh tua koi a om ahita ua? Huan a zawlneite uh tangtawn in a hing uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh ka thute leh ka thusehte, ka sikha zawlneite thupiak a ka piakte, huaite’n na pipute uh a delhphate uh ahi kei maw? Huan a kihei ua, “Sepaihte Toupa’n i tung ua hihdia a ngaihtuah bang in, i omdan bangzel in leh i thilhihte bangzel a i tung ua hih eita ve” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Darias kum nihna, Sebat kha, kha sawmlehkhat ni sawmnih leh li ni’n, Iddo tapa, Berekia tapa Zekariah, zawlnei kiang ah, Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zan in mengmuhna in mi khat sakol san tung a tuang, munliap a om muisingte lak ah ading ka mu a, a nunglam ah sakolte a om ua, a san, a sanpuang leh a ngou ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, “Aw ka Toupa , hiaite bang ahi ua?” ka chi a, huan kei hon houpih angel in ka kiang ah, “Hiaite bang ahi ua k’on ensak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai muising lak a dingpa’n a dawng a, “Hiaite lei a kivialleh a vak dia Toupa’n a sawlte ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in huai muising lak ah ding Toupa’n angel a dawng ua, “Lei a kivialleh in ka vakta ua, ngai in, lei tengteng a tu kinken a, a khawl dide hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Toupa angel in a dawng a, “Aw sepaihte Toupa , hiai kum sawmsagih na hehkhum, Jerusalem tung leh Judah khopite tung ah bang tan chitna neilou ding na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n thuhoihte, thu lungmuanhuaite a kei hon houpih angel a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in kei hon houpih angel in ka kiang ah, hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Thikthusetak in Jerusalem leh Zion ka deihthoh ahi, chi in, nang kikou in: chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan bangmah awlmohlou namte tung ah ka lungkim kei ding a: neukha lel a ka lunghihlouh lai in, siatna a thupisak semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in hichibang in Toupa’n a chi hi: Chitnate toh Jerusalem ah ka kiknawnta a, asung ah inn lam ahi ding, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Hauhsakna ziak in ka khopite a kiphalh ding a; Toupa’n Zion a lungmuan in, Jerusalem a tellai ding hi, chi in, kikou behlap lai in, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan ka dak a, ngai in ki li ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei hon houpih angel kiang ah, “Hiaite bang hi ding ahia?” ka chi a. Aman, “Hiaite Judah, Israel, leh Jerusalem hawlzak mite ahi uh” chi in a hon dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n siksekmi li a hon ensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in ken, “Bang hihdia hiaite hong uh ahi ua?” ka chi hi. Aman thu a gen a, “Kuamah in a lu a dak saklouhna dia, Judah dalhzaksak hiai kite ahi uh: himahleh hiaite, dalhzaksak ding a Judah gam tung a a ki uh sangsak namte dou ding leh a kite uh paikhe ding a hongpai ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan ka dak a, ngai in mi khat a khut a tehna khau tawi ka mu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huailai in ken, “Koilam a hoh ding?” ka chi hi. Aman ka kiang ah, “Jerusalem, a vailam bang tan hi, a dunglam bang tan hiam chih thei ding a teh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan ngai in, kei hon houpih angel a paikhia a, amah kituahpih ding in angel dang khat a paikhe nawn hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kiang ah, “Tai inla, hiai tangvalpa kiang ah, asung a mi leh gante tam mahmah ziak in, khua kulhbang bei bang in Jerusalem luah in a om ding va chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah adia a kimvel a mei kulhbang a hih ding ziak in, leh a lak a thupina ka hih ding ziak in, Toupa’n a chi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khai, khai, mallam gam a kipan taikek un, Toupa’n a chi: van huih lite bang in nou lah k’on dalhzaksakta ngal a, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khai! Zion ah tai in, nang Babulon tanu toh tengkhawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi hi: Thupina khit in aman nang honlok namte kiang ah kei a honsawl hi; kuapeuh nang honkhoih in a mit nauta khoih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, a tung ua ka khut sing ding ka hi a, huchi in a na uh sepsakte ading in gallak ahi ding uh: huan sepaihte Toupa’n kei a honsawl chih na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu, lasa inla, kipak in; ngai in, kei, na lak ua ka teng ding in ka hongpai hi, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hua nichiang in Toupa lam ah nam tampi a kizom khawm ding ua, ka mite ahi ding uh: na lak ah ka teng ding, huchi in sepaihte Toupa’n kei na kiang ah a honsawl chih na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan gam siangthou a a tantuam bang in Toupa’n Judah a luah ding a, Jerusalem a hon tel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dai un, mi tengteng, Toupa ma ah: a omna siangthou a kipan in amah a khanglou in a thoukheta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in siampu lian Joshua Toupa angel ma ading leh Setan a khut taklam a a hek ding ading a hon musak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Setan kiang ah, “Aw Setan, Toupa’n hontai hen; ahi, Jerusalem telpa Toupa’n nang hontai hen: hiai mi kangmei a kipan a sahkhiak ahi ka hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Joshua puansilh nin a kizem in angel ma ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Angel in a ma a dingte kiang ah thu a genta hi. “Amah a kipan puansilh nin lamang un” chi in. Huan a kiang ah, “Ngai in, na thulimlouhna nang a kipan ka lakheta a, puansilh hoih in ka honzem ding hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, ken “A luzang ah lukhu siang koih uhen” ka chi a. Huchi in lukhu siang a luzang ah a koih ua, puansilh in a tuam ua; huchi in Toupa angel kiang nai ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan Toupa angel in Joshua kiang ah hiai thu a gen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Ka lampite a na om a, ka thupiak na zuih leh, ka inkaw vai na hawm ding a, ka vaihawmna innte ah thu na nei dia, hiai a dingte lak a luttheihna k’on pe ding hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw siampu lian Joshua, Tuin za un: nang leh na ma a tu na lawite; amau chiamtehna hoih mite ahi ua: ngai in ka sikha Hiang honpi ding ka hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, Joshua ma a ka suang koih, suang khat mai sagih nei tung ah laigelh ka gelh ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi hi. Ni khat thu in gam pumpi thulimlouhna ka lamang ding hi chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in, na grepgui nuai leh theipi sing nuai ah michih in a invengte na chial ding uh,” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan kei hon houpih angel a hong nawn a, mi ihmulai phawn bang in a hon phawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan ka kiang ah, “Bang na mu a?” a chi a. Ken, “Ngai in, dangkaeng khawnvak koihna, a dawn a a noubem leh huaite a dawn a khawnvak sagih omte ka mu” chi in ka dawng hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Olive sing nih a kiang a om, khat noubem taklam pang ah khat veilam pang ah, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan ka dawng a, kei hon houpih angel kiang ah thu ka gen a. “Hiaite bang ahi ua, ka Toupa ?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei hon houpih angel in a hon dawng a, ka kiang ah. “Hiai bang ahi ua na theikei maw?” a chi a. Ken, ‘Ii,’ theilou Toupa ? ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaitak in aman hon dawng a, ka kiang ah thu a gen a, “Hiai Zerubbabel kiang a Toupa thu ahi: Thahatna in hilou, thilhihtheihna in leng hi samlou, ka Kha in ahizaw, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kua na hia, Aw mual thupi? Zerubbabel ma ah munzang na honghi ding; aman a tung ah, Hehpihna, hehpihna chia kikou in suang poimawh pen a hon lakhe ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huailou in Toupa thu ka kiang a hong tunglai a, hichi in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Zerubbabel khut in hiai inn suangphum a koihkhinta; a khutte mah in a zou ding, huan sepaihte Toupa’n na kiang ah kei a honsawlta chih na thei ding hi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil neu kipatni kua’n a simmawh thei a? Zerubbabel khut ah ulum a mu ding ua kipak ding uhi. Hiai Toupa mit sagihte ahi; lei pumpi kantan a vialtaite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan ken ka dawng a a kiang ah, “Khawnvak koihna taklam pang tung a hiai olive sing nihte leh huai a veilam pang a bang ahi ua?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nihveina ding in ka dong nawn a, a kiang ah, “Dangkaeng sel nihte sik a om, dangkaeng sathau amau a kipan suahzel olive hiang nihte bang ahi ua?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman hondawng a, hiaite bang hi ding ahi ua chih theilou maw? a chi a. Huan ken, “ ‘Ii,’ theilou, ka Toupa ” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaitak in aman, “Hiaite lei pumpi Toupa kiang a ding, thaunilh nihte ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan ka dak nawn a, ngai in, laibuzial leng ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, ‘bang na mu a?’ honchi hi. Ken, “Laibuzial leng ka mu; huai dunglam tong sawmnih ahi a, a vailam tong sawm” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Hiai gam pumpi tung a paikhia hamsia ahi, huai dungzui in kuapeuh guta tu a kipan satkhiak in a om ding ua; huai dungzui in kuapeuh dikloupi a kichiamte tu a kipan satkhiak in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka paikhesak ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi a, gutami inn ah a lut ding, ka min a zuau a hamsia zangmi inn ah; huan a inn ah a om gige dia, a sing a suang toh a negai ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in kei hon houpih angel a paikhia a, ka kiang ah, “Tuin dak inla, bang ahi a paikhia chih en in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ken, “Bang ahia?” ka chi hi. Aman, “Hiai a paikhia ‘Ephah’ ahi, a chi a, huailou in, hiai “Gamsung tengteng a mite khelhna ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, “Ngensin dopkang in a om a; Ephah sung a tu hiai numei ahi” a chilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan aman, “Hiai gitlouhna ahi” a chi a; Ephah sung ah a paisuka; huai a gongtung ah ngengik a ngasuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in ka dak a, ngai in, numei nih a khate uah huih a om a hong paikhia ua, tuivapi bang in kha a nei uhi; huchi in huai Ephah lei leh van kikal ah a domtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei hon houpih angel kiang ah, “Hiaite’n Ephah koilam a paw ding uh ahia?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, “Sinar gam a a inn ding lam ding in, a bawlzoh chiang un amah muntak ah koih in a om ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in ka dak nawn a, ngai in, mual nih kikal a kipan in kangtalai li a hong paikhia ua, huai mualte dal mual ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kangtalai khat in sakol san a nei ua kangtalai nihna in sakol vom;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kangtalai thumna in sakol ngou; kangtalai lina in sakol puang hat a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan kei hon houpih angel ka dong a a kiang ah, “Hiaite bang ahi ua, ka Toupa ?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Angel in a hondawng a, ka kiang ah, “Hiaite van huih lite, lei tengteng Toupa ma a vading khin a paikhete ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sakol vomte omna kangtalai mallam gam ah a paikhia ua; amau zui in angoute tumlam ah a pawtkhia ua; a puangte simlam zuan in a pawtkhia uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan sakolte a paikhia ua, lei kantan a a vialvak theihna ding uh a ngaklah uhi. Aman, “Hiai a kipan pai unla, lei kantan in vialvak un” a chi a, huchi in lei kantan in a vialvak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in honsam a, ka kiang ah thu a gen hi, “Ngai in, mallam gam zuan a paite’n mallam gam ah ka kha a khawlsakta uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saltangte a kipan thilpiak, Heldai, Tobijah, leh Jedai a kipan la in; a ni mah in nang hong inla, Zephaniah tapa Josiah inn ah lut in, Babulon a kipan hongpai ahi na uhiam; chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, amau a kipan dangka leh dangkaeng la inla, kumpilukhute bawl in, Jehozadak tapa Joshua, siampu lian luzang ah khusak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan a kiang ah thugen inla, huchibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Ngai in, mi a min Hiang; a mun a kipan a hong kakhe ding a, aman Toupa biakin a lam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman Toupa Biakin a lam ding a, thupina silhsak in om ding a, a mangtutphah tung ah a tu dia, vai a hawm ding; a mangtutphah tung ah siampu ahi ding; huchi in lemna thuhilhna amau gel kikal ah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpilukhute Helem, Tobijah, Jedai leh Zephaniah tapa Josiah kiang ah, Toupa biakin a theihgigena ding in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan gamlapi a omte a hongpai ding ua Toupa biakin a honglam pih ding ua, huchi in sepaihte Toupa’n kei na kiang ah a honsawl chih na thei ding hi. Huchi in hiai a hongtung ding, Toupa na Pathian aw uttak a na man uleh, a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Darias kum lina in hichi a honghi a, Kisleu kha, kha kua na ni li ni’n, Zekariah kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan amau Bethel a omte’n Serezer leh Regemmelek; leh a mite uh Toupa deihsakna ngen ding in a sawl uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa inn a siampute kiang leh zawlneite kiang a thu vagen ding in. “Kum tampi sung ka na hihsa bang in a kha ngana ah kei leh kei kihihtuam in, kap a sun in an ka ngawl diam?” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huailai in sepaihte Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gam a mite tengteng kiang leh, siampute kiang ah thugen in. Hiai kum sawmsagih sung, a kha ngana leh a kha sagihna a an na ngawl chiang un, kei ding in, keimah ding in na ngawlta uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na nek chiang un, na dawn chiang un, noumau amah ding in na ne un, na dawn uh ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem a kiluah lai leh a hauhsak lai a, a kimvel a khopite leh a Sim leh gamniam gam a kiluah lai a zawlnei masate zang a Toupa tangkoupih hiai thute ahi kei ua hia? chi in chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan Toupa thu Zekariah kiang ah hiai bang in a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n thu a gen hi: Vaihawmna dik hih un, michih in a unau tung ah chitna leh lainatna ensak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meithai nuaisiah kei un, pabeite, mikhual, gentheite leng, na lak ua kuamah in a lungtangin a unau siatna ding gilou ngaihtuah kei hen, chi in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh ngaihkhiak a utkei ua, paupengtak in a ki heimang ua, a zaklouhna ding un a bil uh a hum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, suangtak bang in a lungtang uh a bawl ua, huchi kei leh dan a za kha ding ua, zawlnei masate khut a a Kha a sepaihte Toupa’n a thukhakte a zakha ding uh; huaiziak in sepaihte Toupa a kipan nakpi a hehna a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan hichi a honghi a, Ka kikou lai a a ngaihkhiak louh ziak un a kikou chiang un leng ka ngai khesam kei ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh a theihlouh uh namte lam ah pingpei in amaute ka delhsak ding. Huchi in gam amau nung in a segawp ding a, kuamah in a kantan un a lehkik kei ding uh; gam nuam a sukgawp ziak un, a chi chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in sepaihte Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Thikthusetakin Zion ka deihthoh a, nakpitak a hehna toh amah adin ka phatuamngai hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichibang in Toupa’n a chi: Zion ah kiksak in ka om a, Jerusalem lai ah ka tengding: Jerusalem bel Thutak khopi, sepaihte Toupa mual, mual siangthou a kichi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi; Jerusalem kongzingte ah putekte leh pitekte a hong khosa ding ua, a upat ziak un a khut uah chiangkhun a khunchiat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khopi kongzingte a kimawl in numei leh pasal naupangte in a dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Huai ni chiang a hiai mite lak a omlaite mit a lamdang ahihleh, kei mit ah leng a lamdang sam kei dia hia? sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: ngai in, suahlam gam a kipan leh tumlam gam a kipan, ka mite ka hondam ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau k’on pikhawm ding a, Jerusalem lai ah a teng ding ua; ka mite ahi ding ua, thutak leh diktatna ah, a Pathian uh ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Toupa inn suangphum phum ni a kipan a hiai nite a zawlneite kam a kipan a hiai thu zate’n, tempul a kilam theihna ding in noute khut hatsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai nite malam a mihing adia kilohna a omlouh a, a ganta dia leng kilohna a om samlouh ziak in; melma ziak in a pawtkhia hiam honglut hiam ading in leng muanna himhim a omsak kei a, mi tengteng michih a invengte dou in ka koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh tuin zaw hiai mite lak a omlaite tung ah tuma lam in nite a bang in ka omkei ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan haichi pawi a om ding ahi ngal a; grepgui in a gah a suang ding a, leitung in a pung a omsak ding a, vante’n a daitui uh a pe ding uh; huchi in hiai mite lak a omlaite hiai thil tengteng ka luahsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan hichi a hi ding a, namte lak a hamsia na hihtak bang un, Aw Judah inkawte leh Israel inkawte, huchibang mah in nou k’on hondam ding a; vualzawlna na hi ding uh; lau kei un, himahleh na khutte uh hatsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: Na pipute un a hon hihheh lai ua, na tung ua gilou hih ding ka tup bang in, huchi in ka nem tuankei, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem tung leh Judah inkawte tung ah hoih hih ding tulai nite in ka tum nawnta hi; lau kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na hih ding uh thil hiaite ahi: Michih in a invengte toh thutak kihilh un; na kongpite uah thutak leh lemna vaihawmna hih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan na lak ua kuamah in a invengte siatna ding na lungtang uah gilou ngaihtuah kei un; thuchiam diklou deihkei un; hiaite tengteng ka thil huatlam ahi uh, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan sepaihte Toupa thu ka kiang ah a hongtung nawn hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi; kha lina anngawlna, ngana anngawlna, sagihna anngawlna leh sawmna anngawlna, Judah inkawte ading in nuamna leh kipahna, Ankuangluina vualnopna ahi ding hi; huaiziak in thutak leh lemna deih in, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi; hichibang in a hong omlai ding, mite leh khopi tampite apan a hongpai ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan “Khopi khat a te khopi dang a tengte kiang ah a pai ding ua, Toupa deihsakna ngen ding leh sepaihte Toupa zong ding in kintak in kuanni; keileng ka kuan ding” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi, mi tampite leh nam hatte Jerusalem a Toupa sepaihte zong ding leh Toupa deihsakna ngen ding in a hong kuan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchibang in sepaihte Toupa’n a chi; huai ni chiang in hichi a honghi ding: namte pau tengteng a kipan mi sawm in Judah mipa puanten a len ding ua, “Na kiang ah ka pai ding uh, na kiang ah Pathian a om chih ka za ngal ua” a chi ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hadrad gam dou in Toupa thu a kilak a, Damaska a khawlna mun ahi ding; Aram khopite Toupa a ahi, Israel namte tengteng a hih bang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan pil mahle uh a gamgit pih Hamath, Tura leh Sidon tung a tung ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tura kulh muanhuaitak in a kilamkhia in, dangka leivui bang in vum venvon in, kongzingte buannawi bang in dangkaeng hoih in dim mah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa’n amah neih leh lam a lamang ding a, tuipi a a hauhsakna a hihse ding; huchi in mei a nekgaih a honghi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Askelon in huai a mu ding a, a lau ding; Gaza in leng a mu dia, nakpi a suknat in a om ding; Ekron, a lametna zahlakna ahi ding a; Gaza a kipan kumpipa a mangthang ding a, Askelon luah in a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Ashdod ah chi siangloute a teng ding ua, “Philistiate kisaktheihna ka satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan a kam a kipan a sisan ka lamang ding a, a hate kikal a kipan in a kihhuainate; huchi in amah leng i Pathian ading in omsun ahi ding hi; Jebusmi bang in Judah leh Ekron ah hausa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan sepaihpawlte ziak in ka inn a kimvel in ka um ding, huchi a kuamah a paisuak uhiam a kiknawn louhna ding un; huchi in nuaisiahmi in a paltan nawnta kei ding; tuin ka mit mahmah in ka muta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu, nakpi mahmah in kipak in; Aw Jerusalem tanu, kikou in; ngai in, na kumpipa kiniamkhiak in, sabiltungtung, sabiltung nou tuan ngei nailouhna tung a tuang in na kiang ah a honghi: Amah a diktat a, hotdamna a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ephraim a kipan kangtalai leh Jerusalem a kipan sakol ka satkhe ding a, kidouna thalpeu satkhiak in a om ding a; namte kiang ah lemna thu a gen ding; huchi in a gam tuipi a kipan tuipi tan, luipi a kipan lei tawpnate tan ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang tungthu ah leng, na thukhun sisan ziak in tui omlouhna kawkhuk a kipan in na suangkulhtangte ka sawlkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lametna suangkulh a tangte, kulh muanhuai lam ah kihei un; tuni mahmah in na tung ah a zahnih in k’on dinkik ding chih ka phuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah thalpeu bang in ka lai kulta a, Ephraim thal a bawl in thalpeu ah ka bulhta hi; Aw Zion, na tapate dou ding in na tapate ka tokthou ding, Aw Grik, huchi in mi hat namsau bang in, nang k’on bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in a tung ah Toupa a kimu ding a, khophia bang in a thal a paikhe ding; Toupa Pathian in pengkul a mut dia, simlam pingpei toh a paikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa’n amau a hunkhe ding a; suang sailimgtangte a sikden ding ua; a negai ding ua, uain bang in a sisan uh a dawn ding ua; noubem te bang in a dim ding ua, maitam ningte bang in a kawt ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Toupa a Pathian un amau belamhon bang in a hondam ding a; lallukhu a suangmantamte bang in a gam ah a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi, a hoihna a lian mahmah a, a kilawmna a thupi mahmah a; buh leh bal in tangvalte a tai ding a, uain thak in nungakte a tai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vuah nanung hun in Toupa vuah ngen un, meipite bawlpa Toupa mahmah, huchi in vuahphinte, gam a loupate kiang ah, amaute a pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milimte’n bangmahlou thu a gen un, aisante’n zuau a mu uhi; mang zuauthei a gen ua, a thawn in a lungmuan uh; huaiziak in belamte bang in amau lampi ah a pai ua, belamchingmi a omlouh ziak in hihgim in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Belamchingmite tung ah ka hehna a puakzak a, a heutute uh ka gawt ding” sepaihte Toupa’n Judah inkawte, a belamte a vehta a, kidouna a sakol hoih bang in amau a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau a kipan in a ning a suang, amau a kipan puanin khetphim amau a kipan kidouna thalpeu, amau a kipan vaihawmpa a hong paikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kidouna a kongzing a buannawi a a melmate uh childen in, mihatte bang in a om ding ua; a kiang ua Toupa a om ziak in a dou ding uh; sakol tung a tuangte hih lungzin in a om ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Judah inkawte ka hatsak ding a, Joseph inkawte ka hondam ding, amaute k’on pinawn ding a, amau tung ah chitna ka nei hi; huchi in ka paihkhiak hetlouh bang a honghi ding uh; Toupa a Pathian uh ka hi a, amau ka dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ephraim mite mihatpa in a om ding ua, uain ziak in a lungtang uh a kipak ding a; ahi, a tate un huai a mu ding ua, a kipak ding uh; Toupa ah a lungtang uh a kipak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau ka khutvan ding a, amau ka kaikhawm ding; amau ka tanta hi; A punkhitsa bang un a pung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Namte lak ah hawldalh mah leng; gam gamlate ah kei hon theigige ding uh; huchi in a tate uh toh ka kiang ah hongkik nawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan ka pi nawn ding a, Assuria a kipan ka pi kiknawn ding hi; Gilead leh Lebanon gam ah amau ka pilut ding; amau ading a mun kidaih louh dong in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gimthuakna tuipi a palkai ding ua, tuipi a tui kihawtte khet in a om ding uhi, huchi in Nile luipi thukna tengteng a kangvek ding; Assuria kisaktheihna koihniam in a om dia, Aigupta kumpi chiang a paimang vengveng ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Toupa ah amau ka hihhat ding a; a min in a vaktou un a vaksuk ding uh” Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lebanon, mei in na sidar singte a kattum theihna ding in na kongkhakte hong in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw meilah sing, mau vongvong in, Sidar sing a pukta ngal a, a hoihtatate hihsiat a a om ziak un; Aw nou Bashan tosaw singte chiau vongvong un, gammangpi vatpaih ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un belamchingmite a mau vongvong ding ua, na thupina uh loh a a om ziak in, Ngai un humpinelkai a humham a! Jordan gammang a thengta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichibang in Toupa ka Pathian in a chi hi, “Goh ding belamhon chingpa honghi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau leite’n a that ua, gawt in a omkei ua; amau zuakte’n Toupa phat in om hen! ka hauta uh! Amau chingte’n a lainat kei uhi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Gam a tengte ka hehpih nawn kei ding” Toupa’n a chi. Himahleh ngai in mite michih a invengte khut ah leh, a kumpipa khut ah ka pe ding; amau gam a gawt ding ua, a khut ua kipan amaute ka hunkhe kei ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in belamte a sumdawngte adia thahdia om belamte chingpa ka hong hita hi. Huchi in chiang nih ka kilak a; khat pen ‘Deihsakna’ ka chi a, a dangpen ‘Kizopna’ ka chi; huchi in belamte ka vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan kha khat in belamchingmi thum ka satkhia hi. Himahleh ka kha in amau a chimtak a, amau kha in leng kei a hon chimtak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaitak in ken, “K’on vak kei ding, a sisi, si heh, satkhiak a om ding satkhiak in om heh; nutsiatte khat leh khat sa kine tuah uhen” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan ‘Deihsakna’ chiang ka la a, ka sattan a, mite tengteng toh ka thukhun ka bawl ka suksiat theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in huai ni’n a kitanta huchi in pawlte lak ah a genthei kei hon limsakte’n Toupa thu ahi chih a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ken a kiang uah. “Hoih a na ngaihtuah ua leh, ka lohtak honpia, un ahihkeileh, tang un” ka chi hi. Huchi in ka lohtak ding in ‘dangka sekel sawmthum’ a buk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Ka man dia a seh uh, man hoih belvelmi kiang ah khia in” a chi hi. Dangka sekel sawmthum ka la a Toupa inn a, belvelmi kiang ah ka khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in ka chiang dangpen ‘Kizopna’ ka tumtan a, Judah leh Israel kikal a ki unauna ka suksiat theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n ka kiang ah, “Belamching mihai vanzatte kilak nawn in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai in, gamsung a belamchingmi ka bawlkhe ding hi. Aman satkhiak a om dingte a vehkei dia, delhzak a om dingte leng a zong sam kei dia, satkeh a omte leng a hihdam sam kei ding, a hoih leng a vaksam kei dia, himahleh a thau sa a ne ding a a chinte nangawn uh a tolsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Belamhonte nusia belamchingmi phattuamna bei tung a gik hi; a ban tung leh a mit taklam tung namsau in dou ding a; a ban a keugawp kiuhkeuh ding a, a mit taklam a mial bikbek ding!” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah tungtang a Toupa thu kilakna. Van phalh khia a, lei kingakna koih a, mihing sung a mihing kha koihpa, Toupa’n hichi in a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngai in, khaw kimvel a mite ading in Jerusalem hoina nou in ka bawl ding a, Judah tung ah leng, Jerusalem lakna ah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, mi tengteng ading in Jerusalem suang chimtakhuai in ka bawl ding a, amah ziak a tunggik kisate nakpi a liamsak in a om ding ua, amah dou ding in lei a namte tengteng a kikhawm khawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in lamdangsakna toh sakol chih ka khen ding a, hehna toh a tungtuangmi; huan Judah inkawte tung ah ka mit a hak ding a mittawtna in mite sakol chih ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah hausate’n a lungtang un, Jerusalem a tengte’n sepaihte Toupa a Pathian uah hatna a nei uh” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Huai ni chiang in Judah hausate sing lak a mei am bang in ka bawl dia, buhphal lak a meisel bang in; a kimvel a mite tengteng a negai ding uh. Khut taklam pang leh veilam pang a; Jerusalem amah mun ah a hong tengnawn ding uhi, Jerusalem mahmah ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n amasa in Judah puaninte leng a hondam ding. David inkawte thupina leh Jerusalem a tengte thupina Judah tung a kiliksak louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Toupa’n Jerusalem a tengte a hum ding a, a lak ua hatlou pen leng huai ni chiang in David bang a hi ding ua; David inkawte Pathian bang in a om ding ua, a ma ua pai Toupa angel bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, Jerusalem dou ding a hong kuan namte tengteng hihse ding in ka kuankhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan David inkawte tung leh Jerusalem a tengte tung ah hehpihna leh thumna kha ka sungbaw ding a; a sutpa uh lam a en ding uhi: amah a sun ding ua, min a tapa neihsun a sun bang in, amah, min a tamasa khasetak a a kah bang in, a kah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Jerusalem ah sunna thupi a om ding, Megiddon guam a Hadadrimmon sunna bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan gam pumpin a sun dia; inkuan chih in a tuam in; David nam inkawte a tuam in, a zite un a tuam in; Nathan nam inkawte a tuam in, a zite un a tuam in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levi nam inkawte a tuam in, a zite un a tuam in, Shimei inkawte a tuam in, a zite un a tuam in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />inkuan omlai teng a inkuan chih a tuam in, a zite un a tuam in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in khelhna leh nitna siangsak ding in, David inkawte leh Jerusalem a tengte ading in tuikhuk kihong a hongom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, gam a kipan in milimte minte ka satkhe ding a, theihgige in a omta kei ding uhi; huan zawlneite leh kha nin gam a kipan in ka pai khesak ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, zawlnei kuapeuh a hong kilat lai leh, amah suangtu a nu leh pa’n a kiang ah “Na hing kei ding: Toupa min in zuau na gen a” a chi ding ua; amah suangtu a nu leh pa’n thu a genkholh ziak in amah a sun pailet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, zawlneite thu a genkholhna uah, a mengmuh uah a zahlak chiat ding ua; khem ding in samul phan puanak leng a silh sam kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Zawlnei ka hi kei, leiletmi ka hi; ka tuailai a kipan a sikha a bawl ka hih khittak ziak in” a chi zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi’n a kiang ah, na bante kikal a liamnate bang ahia? a chi ding uhi. Huchi in aman, “Huaite ka lawmte inn sung a ka liamna ahi uh” chi in a dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aw namsau, ka belamchingmi dou ding leh, mi ka lawm dou ding in halh in, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi: belamchingmi khen in, huan belamte a dalh ding uh; huchi in a neute tung ah ka khut ka lik ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan hichi a honghi ding a, gam tengteng ah, huai a seh nih satkhiak in a om dia a si ding uhi; himahleh huai a a thumna nutsiat in a om ding, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan a seh thumna mei a paisuak in ka hontawi dia, dangka hihsiangthou bang in ka hihsiangthou ding a, dangka ettel bang in ka entel ding hi; ka min a lou ding ua, amau ka dawng ding; ka mite ahi, ka chi dia, amau, Toupa ka Pathian ahi” honchi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa ni, na gallak na lak a hawm a a om ding hun a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem dou a galdou ding in nam tengteng ka kaikhawm ding a; khopi lak in a om dia, innte loh in leh numeite sualluih in a om ding uhi; khopi kimkhat sal ah a paikhe ding a, mi omlaite khopi a kipan a satkhiak in a omkei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Toupa a paikhe dia, kidou lai a a dou bang in huai namte a dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Olive mual tung ah ading dia, suahlam pang a Jerusalem mazawn a om ah, huchi in Olive mual bel suahlam sang tumlam sang huai ah a kitam ding hi, huchi in guam thupi mahmah a omta ding; mual kimkhat mallam ah a kimkhat simlam ah a kisuan ding hi. Huchi in ka mualte guam lam ah na taikek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mualte guam Azal tung ding ahi ngal a; ahi, Judah kumpipa Uzzia damlai a zinling ma a kipan na taikek uh bang in; huchi in Toupa ka Pathian a hongpai ding a, a kiang a misiangthoute hon tonpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan huai ni chiang in hichi ahi dia, khovot a omkei dia, vuk a omsam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa adia theih a om ni khat ahi ding; sun hilou, zan hilou; himahleh hichi ahi ding a, nitaklam in khovak a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan huai ni chiang in hichi ahi dia, Jerusalem a kipan in tui hingte a luangkhe dia; a lak ua kimkhat suahlam tuipi ah, a lak ua kimkhat tumlam tuipi ah; nipi leh phalbi in a om den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in leitung tengteng ah Toupa kumpipa ahi ding; huai ni chiang in Toupa khat a min khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem sim Geba a kipan Rimmon tan, gam tengteng phaizang a suak ding a; Jerusalem bel Benjamin kongpi a kipan kongpi khatna chiang, a ning a kongpi chiang, Hananel insang a kipan kumpipa uain sukna pha a kipan khentuam in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ah mite a teng ding ua, hamsia a om nawn kei dia; himahleh Jerusalem ah muangtak in a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Jerusalem kidoupih mite tengteng Toupa’n a gawtna ding hi bel hiai ahi ding; a khe ua a dinlai un, a sa uh a muat dia, a mit hawm sung uah a mit uh a muat ding, a kam sung uah a lei uh a muat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi dia, Toupa a kipan nakpitak a buaina a lak uah a hongom dia; michih in a invengte khut ah a len chinten ding ua, a invengte khut dou ding in a khut a kisa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah in leng Jerusalem ah a dou dia; khokim khovel a namte tengteng hauhsakna dangkaeng, dangka, puansilh a tam a tam in a lakhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchibang in hiai gawtna hipi gamsa tengteng leh sakol, sakolneu, sangawngsau leh sabiltungte puaninte ah hiai gawtna a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi ding a, Jerusalem dou dia hong kuan nam tengteng lak a nutsiat a om michih a kum sik in Kumpipa, sepaihte Toupa , be ding leh biakbukte Ankuangluina nei ding in Jerusalem ah a kuantou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hichi ahi dia, lei a inkaw tengteng, Jerusalem a Kumpipa, sepaihte Toupa , be ding a hohtou lou peuhmah, a tung uah vuah a zukei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta inkuan a hohtouh louh ua, a hongpai kei uleh, amau tung ah leng vuah a zukei ding; biakbukte Ankuangluina nei dia hohtou lou namte gawtna ding hipi a omzaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiai Aigupta gawtna bel biakbukte Ankuangluina nei dia hoh lou nam tengteng gawtna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in sakol longte ah, TOUPA A DING A SIANGTHOU, chih a kigelh ding a; Toupa inn a belte maitam ma a noubemte bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, Jerusalem leh Judah a bel tengteng sepaihte Toupa ading in siangthou ahi ding uh; a kithoihte a hongpai ding ua huai belte la in kithoihna sa a huan ding uhi, huai ni chiang in sepaihte Toupa inn ah Kanaan mi a om nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
